  "body": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QJnIIcD.png\" alt=\"Genetically Modified Monsters Logo\">\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" alt=\"Section Divider\">\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Join our Discord\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Visit our YouTube Channel\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sponsor us on GitHub\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Visit our CurseForge Projects\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Visit our Modrinth\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" alt=\"Section Divider\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" alt=\"About Section Header\">\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <iframe style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\"\n          src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/npNmyb-qqGw?si=zVe_eJuvzaC6uwLI&t=2572\"\n          allowfullscreen\n          title=\"Gameplay Trailer for Genetically Modified Monsters\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\n  <strong>Genetically Modified Monsters</strong> introduces a lineup of powerful, lab-engineered creatures designed to push players to their limits.  \n  Each monster features unique mutations, enhanced behaviors, and unpredictable combat patterns that transform survival into a high-stakes challenge.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" alt=\"Section Divider\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" alt=\"Features Section Header\">\n</p>\n\n<h3><strong>Genetically Modified Creepers</strong></h3>\n\n<p>A new experimental breed of Creepers enhanced through dangerous mutations:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>High-Jump Mutation:</strong>  \n      Can leap several blocks high, letting them ambush players from unexpected angles.\n  </li>\n\n  <li><strong>Wall-Climbing Ability:</strong>  \n      Scales walls and vertical surfaces—no safe hiding spots behind structures.\n  </li>\n\n  <li><strong>Enhanced Mobility:</strong>  \n      Faster speed and superior pathfinding for smarter chasing.\n  </li>\n\n  <li><strong>Adaptive AI:</strong>  \n      Dodges attacks, avoids hazards, and repositions during fights.\n  </li>\n\n  <li><strong>Unique Explosion Variants:</strong>  \n      Mutated blasts up to <strong>2× more powerful</strong> than charged Creepers.\n  </li>\n\n  <li><strong>Stealth Behavior:</strong>  \n      Some variants remain completely silent until the moment they strike.\n  </li>\n\n  <li><strong>Target-Lock Mutation:</strong>  \n      Once they detect a player, they stay locked on—losing aggro becomes nearly impossible.\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n  These Creepers are built to disrupt predictable gameplay and offer intense, adrenaline-pumping encounters.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" alt=\"Section Divider\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" alt=\"Media Section Header\">\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wxiROin.png\" alt=\"Genetically Modified Monster in action\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7dRsV8I.png\" alt=\"Gameplay Screenshot 2\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wLjVDqE.png\" alt=\"Gameplay Screenshot 3\">\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" alt=\"Section Divider\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" alt=\"Installation Section Header\">\n</p>\n\n<div>\n  <p><strong>⏩ Supports: 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5, 1.21.8</strong></p>\n  <p><strong>⏩ Requires NeoForge or Forge</strong></p>\n  <p><strong>⏩ Requires JAUMl Library</strong></p>\n\n  <p>\n    <a href=\"https://builtbybit.com/resources/brainrot-monster-pack-vol-2.76296\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" alt=\"Download Brainrot Monster Pack\">\n    </a>\n  </p>\n</div>\n",
